<svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"> <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"></path> </svg> </a> </div> </div> </section>  <section class="bg-white"> <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 py-24"> <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16"> <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-secondary mb-3">Our Approach</p> <h2 class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold text-primary">How We Work</h2> <p class="mt-4 text-secondary leading-relaxed">A structured four-stage engagement model that produces board-ready, investor-ready outputs.</p> </div> <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-0"> <div class="relative flex flex-col items-start px-6 py-8 border-l-2 border-border lg:border-l-0 lg:border-t-2 first:border-l-0 lg:first:border-t-2">  <div class="hidden lg:block absolute top-0 right-0 w-px h-8 bg-border translate-x-px" aria-hidden="true"></div> <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4"> <span class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary/10 select-none leading-none before:content-[attr(data-n)]" data-n="01" aria-hidden="true"></span> <div class="text-primary"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-7 h-7"><circle cx="16" cy="16" r="12"/><path d="M10 16l4 4 8-8"/></svg></div> </div> <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-primary mb-2">Scope &amp; Diagnose</h3> <p class="text-sm text-secondary leading-relaxed">A structured diagnostic of your current ESG posture, data availability and regulatory obligations.</p> </div><div class="relative flex flex-col items-start px-6 py-8 border-l-2 border-border lg:border-l-0 lg:border-t-2 first:border-l-0 lg:first:border-t-2">  <div class="hidden lg:block absolute top-0 right-0 w-px h-8 bg-border translate-x-px" aria-hidden="true"></div> <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4"> <span class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary/10 select-none leading-none before:content-[attr(data-n)]" data-n="02" aria-hidden="true"></span> <div class="text-primary"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-7 h-7"><path d="M4 24l8-8 6 4 10-12"/><circle cx="28" cy="8" r="2" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg></div> </div> <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-primary mb-2">Engage &amp; Analyse</h3> <p class="text-sm text-secondary leading-relaxed">Stakeholder interviews, quantitative modelling, and benchmarking against peers and frameworks.</p> </div><div class="relative flex flex-col items-start px-6 py-8 border-l-2 border-border lg:border-l-0 lg:border-t-2 first:border-l-0 lg:first:border-t-2">  <div class="hidden lg:block absolute top-0 right-0 w-px h-8 bg-border translate-x-px" aria-hidden="true"></div> <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4"> <span class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary/10 select-none leading-none before:content-[attr(data-n)]" data-n="03" aria-hidden="true"></span> <div class="text-primary"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-7 h-7"><rect x="6" y="4" width="16" height="20" rx="1"/><path d="M22 4h2a2 2 0 012 2v22a2 2 0 01-2 2H8"/><line x1="10" y1="10" x2="18" y2="10"/><line x1="10" y1="15" x2="18" y2="15"/><line x1="10" y1="20" x2="14" y2="20"/></svg></div> </div> <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-primary mb-2">Develop &amp; Deliver</h3> <p class="text-sm text-secondary leading-relaxed">Board-quality reports, models, frameworks and action plans, ready for internal and external use.</p> </div><div class="relative flex flex-col items-start px-6 py-8 border-l-2 border-border lg:border-l-0 lg:border-t-2 first:border-l-0 lg:first:border-t-2">   <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4"> <span class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary/10 select-none leading-none before:content-[attr(data-n)]" data-n="04" aria-hidden="true"></span> <div class="text-primary"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-7 h-7"><path d="M28 16A12 12 0 014.5 20M4 16A12 12 0 0127.5 12"/><path d="M28 12l-0.5 4-3.5-2M4 20l0.5-4 3.5 2"/></svg></div> </div> <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-primary mb-2">Embed &amp; Improve</h3> <p class="text-sm text-secondary leading-relaxed">Optional retained advisory to embed processes, train teams, and iterate as standards evolve.</p> </div> </div> </div> </section>  <section class="bg-primary text-white"> <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 py-24"> <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center"> <div> <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-white/50 mb-3">Why Ace CSR</p> <h2 class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-6">Rigour, Experience, and In-House Delivery</h2> <p class="text-white/70 leading-relaxed mb-6">
Actively consulting since 2011, Ace CSR combines over two decades of practitioner experience with quantitative ESG modelling. Every engagement is managed and delivered in-house; nothing is outsourced.
</p> <ul class="space-y-4"> <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-white/75"> <svg class="w-5 h-5 shrink-0 mt-0.5 text-white/40" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"> <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path> </svg> Over two decades of hands-on ESG and sustainability experience </li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-white/75"> <svg class="w-5 h-5 shrink-0 mt-0.5 text-white/40" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"> <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path> </svg> Climate models using NGFS, CMIP6, IPCC AR6 and SSP pathways </li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-white/75"> <svg class="w-5 h-5 shrink-0 mt-0.5 text-white/40" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"> <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path> </svg> Deep sector expertise across ≈30 industries in Malaysia and beyond </li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-white/75"> <svg class="w-5 h-5 shrink-0 mt-0.5 text-white/40" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"> <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path> </svg> Frameworks: Bursa, IFRS S1/S2, FTSE4Good, MSCI, GRI, GHG Protocol </li> </ul> <a href="/about/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 mt-8 px-6 py-3 border border-white/30 text-white text-sm font-semibold rounded hover:border-white hover:bg-white/10 transition-all">
