</a> </div> <div class="hidden lg:grid grid-cols-2 gap-4"> <div class="bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-6 text-center"> <p class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-2">2011</p> <p class="text-white/50 text-xs uppercase tracking-wide">Consulting since</p> </div><div class="bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-6 text-center"> <p class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-2">20+</p> <p class="text-white/50 text-xs uppercase tracking-wide">Years experience</p> </div><div class="bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-6 text-center"> <p class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-2">≈30</p> <p class="text-white/50 text-xs uppercase tracking-wide">Industries served</p> </div><div class="bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-6 text-center"> <p class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-2">100%</p> <p class="text-white/50 text-xs uppercase tracking-wide">In-house delivery</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section>  <section class="bg-surface"> <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 py-24"> <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-end justify-between mb-14 gap-4"> <div> <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-secondary mb-3">Latest Thinking</p> <h2 class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold text-primary">Insights & Perspectives</h2> </div> <a href="/insights/" class="text-sm font-semibold text-primary hover:text-accent transition-colors shrink-0">
All Insights →
</a> </div> <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8"> <article class="group flex flex-col bg-white border border-border rounded-lg overflow-hidden hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-300"> <!-- Image placeholder --> <div class="relative h-48 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary to-accent overflow-hidden"> <!-- Always rendered, so an article whose artwork does not exist yet, or one
         whose thumbnail fails to load, falls back to the house placeholder
         rather than to a bare gradient. The image paints over it when it loads. --> <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center opacity-10" aria-hidden="true"> <div class="w-32 h-32 border-2 border-white rounded-full"></div> <div class="absolute w-16 h-16 border-2 border-white rounded-full"></div> </div> <img src="/images/insights/hero-double-materiality-finance-card-760.webp" srcset="/images/insights/hero-double-materiality-finance-card-400.webp 400w, /images/insights/hero-double-materiality-finance-card-760.webp 760w, /images/insights/hero-double-materiality-finance-card-1216.webp 1216w" sizes="(min-width: 1280px) 608px, (min-width: 768px) 47vw, 92vw" alt="Double Materiality: The Point Where ESG Becomes a Finance Question" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1216" height="684" class="relative w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" onerror="this.style.display='none'"> <span class="absolute top-4 left-4 px-3 py-1 bg-white/90 text-primary text-xs font-semibold rounded tracking-wide"> ESG Reporting </span> </div> <div class="flex flex-col flex-1 p-6"> <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-secondary mb-3"> <time>August 2026</time> <span>&middot;</span> <span>7 min read</span> </div> <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-primary leading-snug mb-3 group-hover:text-accent transition-colors"> Double Materiality: The Point Where ESG Becomes a Finance Question </h3> <p class="text-sm text-secondary leading-relaxed flex-1"> Sustainability reporting no longer asks only which topics matter. It asks what they are likely to cost, and that is a question the sustainability team cannot answer alone. </p> <a href="/insights/double-materiality-finance/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 mt-5 text-sm font-semibold text-primary hover:text-accent transition-colors"> <span>Read More<span class="sr-only">: Double Materiality: The Point Where ESG Becomes a Finance Question</span></span> <svg class="w-4 h-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"> <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"></path> </svg> </a> </div> </article><article class="group flex flex-col bg-white border border-border rounded-lg overflow-hidden hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-300"> <!-- Image placeholder --> <div class="relative h-48 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary to-accent overflow-hidden"> <!-- Always rendered, so an article whose artwork does not exist yet, or one
         whose thumbnail fails to load, falls back to the house placeholder
         rather than to a bare gradient. The image paints over it when it loads. --> <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center opacity-10" aria-hidden="true"> <div class="w-32 h-32 border-2 border-white rounded-full"></div> <div class="absolute w-16 h-16 border-2 border-white rounded-full"></div> </div> <img src="/images/insights/hero-ifrs-s1-s2-start-now-card-760.webp" srcset="/images/insights/hero-ifrs-s1-s2-start-now-card-400.webp 400w, /images/insights/hero-ifrs-s1-s2-start-now-card-760.webp 760w, /images/insights/hero-ifrs-s1-s2-start-now-card-1216.webp 1216w" sizes="(min-width: 1280px) 608px, (min-width: 768px) 47vw, 92vw" alt="IFRS S1 and S2 in Malaysia: What Companies Should Be Doing Now, Not in 2027" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1216" height="684" class="relative w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" onerror="this.style.display='none'"> <span class="absolute top-4 left-4 px-3 py-1 bg-white/90 text-primary text-xs font-semibold rounded tracking-wide"> ESG Reporting </span> </div> <div class="flex flex-col flex-1 p-6"> <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-secondary mb-3"> <time>August 2026</time> <span>&middot;</span> <span>8 min read</span> </div> <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-primary leading-snug mb-3 group-hover:text-accent transition-colors"> IFRS S1 and S2 in Malaysia: What Companies Should Be Doing Now, Not in 2027 </h3> <p class="text-sm text-secondary leading-relaxed flex-1"> Malaysia&#39;s NSRF phases IFRS S1 and S2 in over three years, reaching full adoption in 2029. But much of what the standards require has to be built through business processes long before it can be reported. </p> <a href="/insights/ifrs-s1-s2-start-now/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 mt-5 text-sm font-semibold text-primary hover:text-accent transition-colors"> <span>Read More<span class="sr-only">: IFRS S1 and S2 in Malaysia: What Companies Should Be Doing Now, Not in 2027</span></span> <svg class="w-4 h-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"> <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"></path> </svg> </a> </div> </article> </div> </div> </section> <section class="bg-primary"> <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 py-20"> <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-8"> <div class="max-w-2xl"> <h2 class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold text-white leading-tight">Ready to Build a More Resilient Business?</h2> <p class="mt-3 text-white/65 text-lg">Speak with our ESG advisors to scope a project tailored to your industry and reporting obligations.</p> </div> <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 shrink-0"> <a href="/contact/" class="px-7 py-3.5 bg-white text-primary text-sm font-semibold rounded hover:bg-white/90 transition-colors"> Contact Us </a> <a href="/services/" class="px-7 py-3.5 border border-white/30 text-white text-sm font-semibold rounded hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors"> View Services </a> </div> </div> </div> </section>  </main> <footer class="bg-primary text-white"> <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 py-10"> <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8"> <!-- Brand --> <div> <a href="/" aria-label="Ace CSR Home"> <img src="/logo.svg" alt="Ace CSR" width="1930" height="396" class="h-8 w-auto brightness-0 invert mb-3"> </a> <p class="text-white/65 text-sm leading-relaxed">
Ace CSR delivers rigorous ESG advisory services to corporations, financial institutions and public bodies across Asia and beyond.
